    "long_instructions": "## DOM Update\r\n\r\n#### Let's take a look at what the steps to make a DOM update look like in code. \r\n\r\n#### In this example, we will change the text inside the box when the button in clicked.\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Activity Preview\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:14pt; margin-top:16px;\">\r\nWatch the video below to see the steps. The video follows the activity on the next level to give you a preview and support. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n![HOLD FOR UPDATING DOM  VIDEO] (https://docs.google.com/videos/d/1g8b5rjdJzyRe5rgbSFQXOcae4dasgSjpVOtCuiv7qbQ/edit?usp=sharing)\r\n"
